    title: "every .h is parsed by BOTH the C and the ObjC analyzer: half of the .h partial-parse rows are one dialect's grammar failing on the other's header (AFNetworking: C 29 vs objc 2; crun: objc 8 on C headers)"  # edbc
    status: todo_hard  # edbc
